extends baseEmail

block content
  h2(style='font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 15px;') Welcome to the Collective, #{firstName}.
  p Thank you for beginning your journey with Velora Skin. We curate pure botanical formulations engineered with clinical precision.
  p To secure your private profile and activate access to exclusive seasonal formulations, please verify your email address.
  .btn-container
    a.btn(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Confirm Email Verification
  p(style='font-size: 13px; color: #78716C;') This verification link remains valid for 24 hours. If you did not initiate this registration, please disregard this transmission.